  "statement": "# Canopy Dash — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nRun forward through a narrow 3D canopy route, make rapid lane, jump, slide, or turn decisions, and complete a bounded course.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA behind-the-back 3D runner with escalating obstacle reading, collision/failure, recovery or retry, and a finish state.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose track chunks, obstacle grammar, speed curve, route length, and environmental zones.\n"
